### ============================================================
### Graph Query Tools - HTTP test cases
### These queries are designed to trigger the 6 Graphiti graph tools
### via the ReAct Agent path.
### Prerequisite:
###   1. NEO4J_ENABLED=true, Neo4j running
###   2. ETL full sync completed (POST /admin/etl/trigger {"sync_type":"full"})
###   3. uvicorn api.main:app --workers 4 --port 8080
### ============================================================

@host = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@prefix = {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent


### ============================================================
### 1. search_knowledge_graph — 自然语言图谱搜索
### ============================================================

### 1a. 搜索供应商相关信息
POST {{prefix}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "在知识图谱中搜索华为科技的所有相关信息，包括采购订单、发票和合同",
    "user_id": "graph_test",
    "session_id": "graph-session-001"
}

### 1b. 搜索物料关联
POST {{prefix}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "搜索钢板（MAT-001）在图谱中的所有关联关系，看它被哪些订单采购过",
    "user_id": "graph_test",
    "session_id": "graph-session-001"
}


### ============================================================
### 2. query_entity_timeline — 实体时间线
### ============================================================

### 2a. PO 完整生命周期
POST {{prefix}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "查看采购订单 PO-2024-0001 的完整时间线，从创建到收货、开票、付款的全过程",
    "user_id": "graph_test",
    "session_id": "graph-session-002"
}

### 2b. 供应商历史
POST {{prefix}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "展示供应商 SUP-001 的业务时间线，看它在过去半年的所有业务活动",
    "user_id": "graph_test",
    "session_id": "graph-session-002"
}


### ============================================================
### 3. query_entity_relationships — 关系网络
### ============================================================

### 3a. 供应商关系网络
POST {{prefix}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "查询供应商 SUP-002（中兴通讯）的关系网络，看它关联了哪些采购订单、发票和合同",
    "user_id": "graph_test",
    "session_id": "graph-session-003"
}

### 3b. 发票关系溯源
POST {{prefix}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "查看发票 INV-2024-0001 的完整关系链路，包括关联的PO、收货单和付款记录",
    "user_id": "graph_test",
    "session_id": "graph-session-003"
}


### ============================================================
### 4. query_supplier_profile — 供应商全景画像
### ============================================================

### 4a. 单个供应商画像
POST {{prefix}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "生成供应商 SUP-001（华为科技）的全景画像，聚合采购、交付、发票、付款、合同等多维度信息",
    "user_id": "graph_test",
    "session_id": "graph-session-004"
}


### ============================================================
### 5. compare_entities — 实体对比
### ============================================================

### 5a. 供应商对比
POST {{prefix}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "对比供应商 SUP-001（华为科技）和 SUP-002（中兴通讯）在交付、定价、合规方面的表现差异",
    "user_id": "graph_test",
    "session_id": "graph-session-005"
}


### ============================================================
### 6. detect_graph_anomalies — 图结构异常检测
### ============================================================

### 6a. 全面异常检测
POST {{prefix}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "基于图谱结构检测采购流程中的异常模式，包括无收货的PO、无关联PO的发票、孤立付款等",
    "user_id": "graph_test",
    "session_id": "graph-session-006"
}

### 6b. 特定异常检测
POST {{prefix}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "检测最近30天内有哪些采购订单没有收货记录，可能存在交付风险",
    "user_id": "graph_test",
    "session_id": "graph-session-006"
}


### ============================================================
### 强制走 ReAct Agent 路径的查询（不命中任何 DAG 模板）
### 通过 analysis_type=comprehensive 但不包含标准分析关键词，
### 或使用明确要求图谱工具的措辞，触发 Agent 自主选择图查询工具。
### ============================================================

### ★ 推荐测试：直接要求搜索图谱（最可能触发图查询）
POST {{prefix}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "请在知识图谱中搜索华为科技（SUP-001）的所有关联实体和关系，用 search_knowledge_graph 工具",
    "user_id": "graph_test",
    "session_id": "graph-session-react-1"
}

